      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BALL OF SMOKE (5) clocked a speedy 25.97 despite finishing fourth over 457m at this track last start. Hard to top on the time from last start. IANDRA GRACE (7) goes very well this trip starting six times for two wins and two minors. Scored by 0.8 lengths last time (18.99) in a Grade 5 over 330m at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. EFFERVESCENCE (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 19.13 beating Lumeah Rocket. Won at her only start from this box. Can make it two on the bounce. CALL ME SNUGGLES (8) can play a role coming off a short let-up.",
